:: Robin Watch

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<if $robinhugging is 1>>
	You keep your arms around Robin while <<he>> plays, leaning against <<him>> as you watch the screen.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	You sit beside Robin and watch <<him>> play.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $rng gte 81>>
	<<wearProp "game controller">>
	Robin gets stuck on a difficult part. After failing the same section several times, <<he>> drops the controller into your lap. "You try," <<he>> says, lying back on the bed.
	<br><br>
	<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
		You take the controller and try to copy what Robin was doing, but your breathing turns uneven and your hands start to shake. You lose track of the game as the pleasure peaks.
		<<orgasm>>
		Robin turns <<his>> face away to give you some privacy, though <<he>> shifts awkwardly on the bed while <<his>> cheeks turn red.<<npcincr Robin lust 1>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Pass the controller back|Robin Watch Pass]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You try the same section and clear it on your first attempt. Robin lifts <<his>> head from the bed to look at the screen.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Pass the controller back|Robin Watch Pass]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Tease|Robin Watch Tease]]>><<npcincr Robin love -1>><<npcincr Robin dom -1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
	Robin starts making <<his>> character run in circles, jump into walls and generally play as badly as possible just to make you laugh. It works, and <<he>> grins when you start laughing beside <<him>>.
	<br><br>
	<<robinoptions>>
<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
	You chat while Robin plays. <<He>> keeps answering without taking <<his>> eyes off the screen, <<his>> thumbs moving across the controller as <<he>> works through the game.
	<br><br>
	<<robinoptions>>
<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
	You try to chat with <<him>>, but Robin leans towards the screen and only gives you short answers. <<Hes>> too focused on the game to look away.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Robin.love gte 80>>
		<<link [[Use Robin's lap as a pillow|Robin Pillow]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<trauma -3>><</link>><<glove>><<glust>><<gdom>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Keep watching|Robin Options]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<robinoptions>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Robin shifts sideways until <<his>> head rests in your lap, keeping the controller in <<his>> hands as <<he>> carries on playing. The weight of <<his>> head presses into your thighs, and your face starts to feel warm.
	<<garousal>><<arousal 300>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Stroke|Robin Stroke]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><</link>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Keep watching|Robin Options]]>><</link>>
	<br><br><br>
<</if>>

:: Robin Play

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>><<wearProp "game controller">>
<!-- robin cdquest 1 event -->
<<if $rng gte 86 and _robin.cdquest is 1 and _robin.crossdressing gte 2 and !$daily.robin.cdevent and _robin.trauma lte 20>>
	You play a cooperative game with <<him>>. You're almost at the end of the stage when someone knocks on the door, making Robin stop with <<his>> thumb still pressed to the controller.
	<br><br>

	<<if npcIsGenderflipped("Robin")>>
		Robin, still wearing <<his>> <<npcClothesText _robin "upper">>, goes pale and puts a hand over <<his>> changed chest.
		"They're going to see me like <span class="italic">this</span>," <<he>> whispers. "Not just the clothes. All of it."
	<<else>>
		Robin, still wearing <<his>>
		<<if _robin.startingSex is "f">>
			<<npcClothesText _robin "upper">> and chest binder,
		<<else>>
			<<npcClothesText _robin "upper">>,
		<</if>>
		looks down at <<his>> clothes, then towards the door as <<his>> face turns red. "This looks bad, doesn't it?"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Let Robin respond|Robin CD Door Answer]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Tell Robin to ignore it|Robin CD Door Ignore]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 81>>
	You play a cooperative game with <<him>>, passing items back and forth and covering each other whenever one of you gets into trouble. By the end of the stage, you're both smiling at the screen.
	<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
	<br><br>
	<<robinoptions>>
<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
	You play a game with <<him>>, but Robin takes the lead early and keeps it. By the time the round ends, <<he>> has beaten you easily.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Accept defeat with grace|Robin Play Grace]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<stress 3>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Make excuses|Robin Play Excuses]]>><<npcincr Robin love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
	You take the lead early and never lose it. When the round ends, Robin lowers <<his>> controller and frowns at the score.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Cheer Robin up|Robin Play Cheer]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Tease|Robin Play Tease]]>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<npcincr Robin love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
	<br>
<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
	You play a game with <<him>>. You draw. "I'll get you next time," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
	<<robinoptions>>
<<else>>
	You play against <<him>>. Robin starts winning, smiling more each time <<he>> scores.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Tickle attack|Robin Play Tickle]]>><<npcincr Robin dom -1>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><</link>><<glust>><<ldom>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Play fair|Robin Play Fair]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Robin Watch Pass

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
You hand the controller back to Robin. <<He>> sits up and checks the screen again. "You did it! Thanks."
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Watch Tease

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Are you alright?" you ask, smirking. "I think Bailey could have managed that one."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	You try to hold back a smile. "Um... I think Bailey could have managed that one."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You hold the controller out to <<him>>, still smiling. "Sorry, but I think Bailey could have managed that one."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"That looked harder when you were doing it," you say, smiling as you hand the controller back.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"See? Easy," you say, holding the controller out to <<him>>.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I did it," you say. "I'm the champion now. I claim this console as my prize."
<<else>>
	"Wow, that was really easy," you say, smirking.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Robin sits up and reaches across you for the controller. "You got lucky," <<he>> says, snatching it back before you can keep it away from <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Play Grace

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"You were really good," you admit. "I didn't have much chance of winning."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"You won without cheating," you say. "You're much better at this than me."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Good game," you say. "You're really good at this."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Alright, you got me," you say. "That was good."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Fine, you win," you say with a grin. "This time."
<<else>>
	"You're good at this," you say.
<</if>>
Robin sits a little straighter and smiles at the screen.
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Play Excuses

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I wasn't really trying," you say, looking away. "You still nearly lost."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I got distracted," you say. "That's all."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I think I was still getting used to the controls," you say. "Maybe I'd do better if we played again."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"You got an easy round," you say. "I'll beat you next time."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I let you have that one," you say. "You looked like you needed the win."
<<else>>
	"I-I let you win," you say. "And you almost lost anyway."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Sure," <<he>> says sarcastically, giving you a sideways look. "I bet you'll let me win the next one too."
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Play Cheer

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I got lucky," you say. "You almost had me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"You were doing well," you say. "I just got lucky at the end."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"That was close," you say. "You played well."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I won, but that was close," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Don't sulk. You nearly had me," you say, nudging <<his>> arm.
<<else>>
	"I got lucky," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Robin looks back at the screen, then smiles. "You made it look easy," <<he>> says. "But thanks for not rubbing it in."
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Play Tease

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I won!" you exclaim. "And I'm not even any good."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I won!" you say, sounding more surprised than smug. "I really thought you'd beat me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I actually won," you say, smiling at <<him>>. "I wasn't expecting that."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Good game," you say. "I still won, though."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"You nearly had me," you say, smiling. "Nearly."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"There's no shame in losing to the best," you say.
<<else>>
	"You played well," you say. "I was still better."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Robin points the controller at you. "I'll get you next time," <<he>> says. "Just you wait."
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Play Tickle

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
You reach over and run your fingers across Robin's stomach. <<He>> yelps and twists away, trying to protect <<his>> sides without dropping the controller. "No fair!" <<he>> shouts.
<br><br>
Robin loses track of the game while trying to escape your fingers. You take the lead, then keep it until the round ends.
<br><br>
"You're lucky you're a guest in my room," <<he>> says, folding <<his>> arms as <<he>> looks at the result.
<br><br>
<<link [[Apologise|Robin Play Apologise]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>>
<br>
<<if ($robinromance is 1 or $robinsexfriend)>>
	<<link [[Apologise lewdly|Robin Play Apologise Lewd]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Bask in victory|Robin Options]]>><<npcincr Robin love -1>><<npcincr Robin dom -1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
<br>

:: Robin Play Fair

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<wearProp "game controller">>
You keep your hands to yourself and concentrate on the game.
<br><br>
<<if $rng gte 51>>
	Robin takes advantage of every mistake you make and beats you easily.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Accept defeat with grace|Robin Play Grace]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<stress 3>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Make excuses|Robin Play Excuses]]>><<npcincr Robin love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You stay ahead through most of the round and win. Robin stares at the final score, then lowers <<his>> controller into <<his>> lap.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Cheer Robin up|Robin Play Cheer]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Tease|Robin Play Tease]]>><<npcincr Robin dom -1>><<npcincr Robin love -1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Robin Play Apologise

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "It was the only way I could win."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm sorry," you say. "I panicked when you started winning."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Sorry," you say. "That wasn't very fair of me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Sorry," you say. "I cheated. You were winning."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Sorry," you say. "That was uncalled for."
<<else>>
	"Sorry," you say. "I know you wouldn't do that to me."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Robin relaxes <<his>> arms and picks the controller up again. "It's okay," <<he>> says. "It just surprised me."
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

