You tug Robin's shirt up and kiss <<his>> stomach. <<His>> body jerks at the first touch, and <<he>> keeps <<his>> hands close to <<his>> sides, expecting you to tickle <<him>> again. When you keep kissing <<him>> instead, <<he>> stops trying to pull away.
