You climb over <<him>> and keep teasing <<his>> nipple with your tongue. Robin falls back against the bed and grips your side, staying there while you continue. When you finally lift your head, <<he>> keeps <<his>> eyes closed and breathes through <<his>> mouth. Once <<his>> breathing slows, <<he>> opens <<his>> eyes and looks up at you.
