:: Robin Pillow

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
You lie on your side and rest your head in Robin's lap. <<He>> shifts <<his>> legs so you're comfortable, then rests one arm across your shoulder. <<He>> carries on playing with the other hand, occasionally rubbing your scalp or brushing <<his>> fingers across your cheek.
<br><br>
The slow movement of <<his>> hand helps you relax, and you eventually fall asleep while Robin keeps playing.
<br><br>
When you wake, the game is still running, so you can't have slept for long. Robin pauses it and helps you sit up, keeping one hand on your shoulder until you are steady. "I hope you're sleeping properly," <<he>> says. Once <<he>> sees that you're fully awake, <<he>> smiles. "Are my thighs soft?"
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>

